          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 972,
          "end": 976
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 980,
          "end": 983
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.29364684224128723
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "It is the submission of learned counsel for the applicants that false case has been registered against them and they are suffering confinement since 25- 11-2019 and suffered sufficient period of custody.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 988,
      "end": 1191,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "25- 11-2019",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1137,
          "end": 1148
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23057758808135986
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "They are innocent and falsely implicated.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1192,
      "end": 1233,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3133058547973633
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Trial will take time to conclude.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1234,
      "end": 1267,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Therefore, on this ground they sought bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1268,
      "end": 1311,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26507696509361267
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "3. Learned counsel for the respondent/State opposed the prayer and submitted that applicants are kingpin of all the crime committed by Adarsh Credit Cooperative Society.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1312,
      "end": 1482,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Adarsh Credit Cooperative Society",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1448,
          "end": 1481
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28990161418914795
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "More than 800 crores of money of public at large has been taken and siphoned off by the applicants.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1483,
      "end": 1582,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.34680286049842834
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Many cases are registered against them in Rajasthan as well as in Madhya Pradesh.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1583,
      "end": 1664,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rajasthan",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1625,
          "end": 1634
        },
        {
          "text": "Madhya Pradesh",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1649,
          "end": 1663
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2820771634578705
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "They cheated the complainant and taken his hard earned money.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1665,
      "end": 1726,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4320790767669678
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "If they are released on bail then they shall misuse the liberty and they will affect the course of trial.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1727,
      "end": 1832,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26024365425109863
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Rahul Modi vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 12 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/188277029/\n1",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1833,
      "end": 1949,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rahul Modi vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 12 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1834,
          "end": 1906
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3353574872016907
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "4. Complainant appeared in person, opposed the prayer and submitted that they took hard earned money of him, his mother, father and wife.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1950,
      "end": 2087,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2685026228427887
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "All the family members were cheated by the applicants and other co-accused.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2088,
      "end": 2163,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.299015611410141
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "Looking to their tainted background and the manner in which they siphoned off money and looted from public at large, their case be dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2164,
      "end": 2305,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3261147141456604
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "5. Heard learned counsel for the parties at length and perused the case diary.\n6.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2307,
      "end": 2388,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "From perusal of case diary and nature of allegations, it appears that applicants are directors in Adarsh Credit Cooperative Society.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2389,
      "end": 2521,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Adarsh Credit Cooperative Society",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2487,
          "end": 2520
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20735767483711243
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "In the name of Credit Cooperative Society, applicants collected huge amount of money from the people of Rajasthan as well as from Madhya Pradesh.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2522,
      "end": 2667,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rajasthan",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2626,
          "end": 2635
        },
        {
          "text": "Madhya Pradesh",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2652,
          "end": 2666
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.31912222504615784
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "Thereafter,\nthey took money and eloped.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2668,
      "end": 2707,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32147011160850525
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "Money was taken on the pretext to give good returns but principal amount itself is being siphoned off.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2708,
      "end": 2810,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3580692708492279
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "7. Looking to the cascading effect of allegations and registration of cases against the applicants at different places, this Court is of the considered view that no case for grant of bail is made out in favour of applicants, at this stage.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2811,
      "end": 3051,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32230326533317566
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "Application sans merits and is hereby dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3052,
      "end": 3100,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.05865254998207092
